&nbsp;</p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Let’s face it - calling leads is time consuming and often monotonous. But what if there was a way to see +</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">20% higher bind rates</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> with leads </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">and</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none"> save your team countless hours of extra prospecting calls – </span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">all for no extra cost?</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:14px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none">Right now we’re offering select agents access to EverQuote’s </span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://2287971.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/2287971/2025%20LCS%201-Pager.pdf" style="text-decoration:none"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#1155cc"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:underline"><span style="text-decoration-skip-ink:none">Lead Connection Service (LCS)</span></span></span></span></span></span></a><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:700"><span style="font-style:italic"><span style="text-decoration:none"> FREE through May 31, 2025</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">. With LCS our best-in-class outreach team calls your leads for you, transferring any insurance shoppers who are ready for a quote.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Agents using LCS average 20%-30% higher lead bind rates and significantly increase the amount of leads they can work. Plus we automate your lead returns to save you even more time and money.</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Available lead volume is in high demand in many areas, so I’d love to grab 5-10 minutes of your time to discuss. You can reach me at {{{Sender.Phone}}} o</span></span></span></span></span><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">r you can book time directly with an LCS Specialist here- </span></span></span></span></span>{{{Sender.Salesforce_Meeting_Link__c}}}</span></span></p>

